{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48964","headline":"寄李处士 · 曹松","name":"寄李处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僧话磻溪叟，平生重赤松。\n夜堂悲蟋蟀，秋水老芙蓉。\n吟坐倦垂钓，闲行多倚筇。\n闻名来已久，未得一相逢。\n塔见移来影，钟闻过去声。\n一斋唯默坐，应笑我营营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}